A Brainfuck interpreter in C.

I thought it would be fun to make. :)

You can create any script with this, and if you can't be bothered to make your own script, then here is one to use:

>++++++++[<+++++++++>-]<.>++++[<+++++++>-]<+.+++++++..+++.>>++++++[<+++++++>-]<+
+.------------.>++++++[<+++++++++>-]<+.<.+++.------.--------.>>>++++[<++++++++>-
]<+.

(Source: https://therenegadecoder.com/code/hello-world-in-brainfuck/)
